    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813710/extras/5e6d8478524c722e8e8493f4e93c2bf3.poster.avif?t=1749857070\" width=623 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813710/extras/5e6d8478524c722e8e8493f4e93c2bf3.webm?t=1749857070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Use the <strong>free \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<i>Gardener Plant Creator</i>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f app to design plant species</strong> that can be simulated and grown in game \ud83c\udf40<strong><i>Gardener: Master of Trees and Flowers</i></strong>\ud83c\udf40. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your plant designs with friends and the community on Steam Workshop. Generate Plant Nucleotide Genome\u00a0files at the touch of a button for easy uploading and downloading.<strong> Simply drag and drop the png files</strong> containing plants into the game to import new species.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813710/extras/56587bf4ad674d5938620a07f5a36a5d.poster.avif?t=1749857070\" width=610 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813710/extras/56587bf4ad674d5938620a07f5a36a5d.webm?t=1749857070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813710/extras/56587bf4ad674d5938620a07f5a36a5d.mp4?t=1749857070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813710/extras/5e6d8478524c722e8e8493f4e93c2bf3.poster.avif?t=1749857070\" width=623 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813710/extras/5e6d8478524c722e8e8493f4e93c2bf3.webm?t=1749857070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Use the <strong>free \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<i>Gardener Plant Creator</i>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f app to design plant species</strong> that can be simulated and grown in game \ud83c\udf40<strong><i>Gardener: Master of Trees and Flowers</i></strong>\ud83c\udf40. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your plant designs with friends and the community on Steam Workshop. Generate Plant Nucleotide Genome\u00a0files at the touch of a button for easy uploading and downloading.<strong> Simply drag and drop the png files</strong> containing plants into the game to import new species.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813710/extras/56587bf4ad674d5938620a07f5a36a5d.poster.avif?t=1749857070\" width=610 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813710/extras/56587bf4ad674d5938620a07f5a36a5d.webm?t=1749857070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2813710/extras/56587bf4ad674d5938620a07f5a36a5d.mp4?t=1749857070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
